\ulnone\cf2 The NT Labor senator Malarndirri McCarthy says Burney has gone to the territory several times for extensive briefings in recent months, and that since December it has been a \u8220 deeply traumatic time\u8221  for everyone in central Australia, with the recent prime minister\u8217 s visit and subsequent restrictions needed as a \u8220 circuit breaker\u8221 .}
